    <!-- First run. -->
    <string name="ob_welcome">Welcome to Zella</string>
    <string name="ob_welcome_detail">Record your screen or yourself, let Zella cut it, and share a video. Free, with no watermark and no account.</string>
    <string name="ob_how">How it works</string>
    <string name="ob_how_1">Record, or pick a video you already have.</string>
    <string name="ob_how_2">Tap Auto-Polish, and Zella cuts the silences, cleans your voice and frames you.</string>
    <string name="ob_how_3">Add captions, a look or music if you like, then export.</string>
    <string name="ob_private">What stays on your phone</string>
    <string name="ob_private_detail">Recording, captions, cutting, removing the background and exporting all happen on this phone. Your video is not sent anywhere.</string>
    <string name="ob_private_extras">Three optional things use the internet, and each says so when you use it: the Assistant, if you add your own key (it sends your words and a short text summary, including captions); stock video clips (it sends a search word); and bigger caption downloads.</string>
    <string name="ob_free">What is free</string>
    <string name="ob_free_detail">Everything in the editor and all the AI, for good. Exports up to 2 minutes at up to 1080p.</string>
    <string name="ob_week">For your first 7 days you also get the full Pro set, with nothing to pay. It ends by itself and Zella stays free.</string>
